e\n  independent-review section of [`DOCS/guides/agent-roles.md`](DOCS/guides/agent-roles.md).\n- Stale skills (`dotnet`, `devops`, `pydantic-ai`, `tailwind-4`) — they\n  legislated for stacks this repo does not have.\n\n</INSTRUCTIONS>"
